        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bono\n- Bands: Florence and the Machine, U2\n- Tours: Lungs Tour, 360° Tour\n- Songs: Your Blue Room\n\nFacts:\n- Florence and the Machine's Lungs Tour supported U2 on the European leg of U2's two-year 360° Tour.\n- U2 is the band fronted by Bono.\n- U2's 360° Tour used a round stage design.\n- U2 performed \"Your Blue Room\" live for the first time on the 360° Tour.",
