        "original_id": "266599fa-3940-570d-97f9-757d9a7e4a36",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bono\n- Organizations: U2\n- Events: U2 360° Tour, Lungs Tour\n- Products: \"Electrical Storm\"\n- Concepts: in the round staging\n\nFacts:\n- U2 is a rock band, and Bono is its lead vocalist and primary lyricist.\n- The U2 360° Tour was a worldwide concert tour by U2.\n- The U2 360° Tour used an in-the-round circular stage that allowed the audience to surround the band on all sides.\n- U2 did not perform \"Electrical Storm\" live until 2 July 2009, when the band played it at the second Barcelona concert of the U2 360° Tour.\n- In 2011, an act associated with the Lungs Tour also supported U2 on the U2 360° Tour.",
